    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "你们上次是真把我激怒了，我把这件事告诉了气功教主，你猜他怎么说？",
              "en": "You really got my goat last time.I told the Qigong master about it.Guess what he said?"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "我并不知道气功教主说了什么。",
              "en": "I had no idae what the Qigong master was saying."
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "警告！警告！数据显示有三股强大的能量向这里逼近！",
              "en": "Warning!Warning!Data shows that three powerful energy streams are approaching here!"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "说的没错，气功教主表示自己要带领两个弟弟联合讨伐你们！",
              "en": "That's right,the Qigong master said he will lead his two younger brothers to jointly attack you! "
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "这可不是什么好兆头。",
              "en": "That's not a good sign."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
        "EditorFirstIntroNarrative"
      ]
    },
    {
      "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
      "objdata": {
        "Flow": [
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "什么？！他们连手都没都没能将你打败？这不可能！",
              "en": "What?They couldn't beat you even working together?That's impossible!"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "winnie",
            "Action": "NPC_ENTER",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "crazydave",
            "Action": "EXCITED",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "这就是劫后余生的感觉吗？太惊险了！",
              "en": "So this is what it feels like to survive a near-death experience?It's a rush!"
            }
          },
          {
            "Character": "zombossicon",
            "Action": "SAY",
            "Lines": {
              "zh": "看来我必须亲手打败你们了，等着瞧吧。",
              "en": "Looks like I'll have to take you on myself."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "aliases": [
